          "body": "It could. Both calls depend only on `req.UserID`. The diff keeps them [sequential](rr:code/pkg/ranker/request_builder.go#L46-54) and gives no reason, so the habit call's time adds to every request; its context timeout is 30 ms. The diff has no latency measurements.\n\nI added a section with an errgroup sketch instead of repeating it here:\n\n![](rr:doc/parallel-sketch)"
